Source-assisted selected reading of F-x3yo, Gent, Bisschoppelijk Archief, fragment nr. 17, fol. [1]r. All twelve written lines were reread on the image by a research reader; entry 2 and entry 3 were settled with the printed titles, entry 9 with the sale and manuscript catalogues. Abbreviations resolved in round brackets; ? marks an uncertain reading.
Image: https://fragmentarium.ms:443/loris/F-x3yo/ba_gent_20240117a_0063_fragm_17.jp2/full/2328,/0/default.jpg (canvas fol. [1]r), native-pixel box 100,80,2000,1650. The verso (canvas fol. [1]v) is blank.

Liber fr(atru)m Regulariu(m) in s(an)c(t)o Leonardo iuxta leodiu(m) :
    Et (con)tine(n)t(ur) in eo que sequu(n)t(ur) :
// P(ri)mo 4or libri dyalogor(um) b(ea)ti g(re)gorij p(a)pe
// Rosacea corona augustissi(m)e cristifere marie.
// Ep(isto)le et Carmi(n)a i(n) q(ui)b(us) repudiat(ur) filia regis ro(ma)nor(um)
    p(er) karolu(m) rege(m) fra(n)cor(um) viij?
// Cor ubi es · i(n) refecto(ri)o. Cor ubi es i(n) cho(ro). Cor ubi es · i(n) dormito(ri)o.
// Tabula i(n)dulge(n)ciar(um) ordi(ni)s cano(n)icor(um) regulariu(m) de wi(n)des(em)
// Tabulare fr(atru)m ordi(ni)s deifere v(ir)gi(ni)s ma(r)ie de carmelo
// Co(n)s(er)vatoriu(m) cleri civitatis (et) dioces(is) leodien(sis) p(er)petuu(m)
// Tractat(us) gerson de t(ri)bulat(i)o(n)ib(us) ex defectuoso regimi(n)e
    ecclesiasticor(um) adhuc eccl(esi)e p(ro)venturis
// Vita s(an)c(t)i Gerardi abb(at)is (et) co(n)fess(oris) fu(n)dato(r)is eccl(esi)e bronien(sis)
// Tractat(us) de tractat(i)o(n)e (et) susceptio(n)e ven(erabi)lis sac(ra)m(en)ti in sp(eci)ali? (et) g(e)n(er)ali
    2o de p(er)tine(n)tib(us) hoc ven(erabi)le sac(ra)m(entu)m. 3o de p(er)icul(is) (con)tinge(n)tib(us)
    circa hoc ven(erabi)le sac(ra)m(entu)m :
